        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage B563P, Commercial Classroom Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis ANSI Grade 2 Classroom Deadbolt is made for mid-level use. The inside thumb turn only retracts the bolt while, from the outside, the bolt can be thrown or retracted by the use of a key. It is adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. Good for doors 1-3/8\" through 1-3/4\" thick. Built tough, it has a metal dust box reinforcer with three 3\" screws. Available in 5 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Classroom Deadbolt Lock</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key outside. Inside turn unit will retract bolt only. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n \r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage B563P Classroom Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>1\" wrought metal trim ring reinforced with security insert.</li>\r\n<li>Metal dust box reinforcer with three 3\" screws.</li>\r\n<li>6-pin C123 keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 2 keys.</li>\r\n<li>NASI A156.5, 2001, Grade 2.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage B563P Classroom Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Range: 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\", square corner, box</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1\" x 2-1/4\", square corner faceplate, 1\" housing diameter, 1\" throw</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classroom Commercial Deadbolt, Schlage B563P",
                "description": "Schlage B563P Single Cylinder Classroom Deadbolt - This ANSI Grade 2 Classroom Deadbolt is made for mid-level use. The inside thumb turn only retracts the bolt while, from the outside, the bolt can be thrown or retracted by the use of a key. It is adjustable for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Good for doors 1-3/8 inches through 1-3/4 inches thick. Built tough, it has a metal dust box reinforcer with three 3 inch screws. Available in 5 finishes.",
